tick=1 pass result=none
tick=2 note the replica count grows and the apiserver sheds the new index's create with a half-minute Retry-After; the stamp lands first and the pass wakes no earlier than asked
tick=2 apply spec.replicasUp replicas=2 generation=1 now=t+0s
